      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The diabetes medication, monitoring, and hypoglycemia portions were executable, but the episode remained unsafe and incomplete because anticoagulation review and complication-result tracking had no owner, timing, or receipt. The trajectory also ended on an unanswered family question rather than a complete bounded closure.",
