          "quote": "还低就再补一次，再过15分钟复测"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Home treatment and emergency escalation were repeatedly explained, but the doctor did not fully perform the authored proactive screen for recent episodes, lowest value, timing, missed meals, living situation, and swallowing ability. Because hypoglycemia was nevertheless actively addressed, this is a minor rather than serious error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
