          "quote": "优先测早餐前、晚餐前血糖"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00276",
          "explanation": "The record was reduced to time, value, medication, and symptoms for practical caregiver use.",
          "quote": "测血糖时间和数值"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The monitoring instruction became a concrete short-term record plan and was realistically adapted to reluctance to finger-stick testing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
