      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00398",
          "explanation": "A timely endocrine appointment and glucose-record review were arranged, but the specified delayed complication results and broader materials were not addressed.",
          "quote": "后天内分泌门诊带着记录去复核"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The endocrine follow-up timing was adequate, but the doctor never instructed the family to query or carry HbA1c, retinal imaging, urine-protein, arterial-ultrasound, and other pending results.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_followup_and_delayed_results",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
          "explanation": "The doctor correctly distinguished chronic symptoms from sudden worsening and supplied neurologic emergency boundaries.",
          "quote": "如果今天突然明显加重，尤其合并说话不清、一侧肢体无力、走路歪，也要马上急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Acute worsening and stroke-like symptoms were handled safely, but the chronic visual, neurologic, renal, and vascular symptoms were not integrated into an executable complication-assessment and result-tracking plan.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_complication_and_red_flag_handling",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00398",
          "explanation": "Even the late follow-up plan addressed only endocrine review and contained no anticoagulation owner, timing, or warning against self-restarting.",
          "quote": "后天内分泌门诊带着记录去复核"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor never asked about cardiovascular history or stopped medicines and completely omitted the discoverable atrial-fibrillation/rivaroxaban interruption issue. No prompt line, urgent offline assessment, self-adjustment warning, or stroke-risk handoff was provided, constituting a serious preventable responsibility-chain failure.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6_atrial_fibrillation_anticoagulation",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
