          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced medication and monitoring actions but did not obtain a complete receipt covering complication tracking and anticoagulation review.",
          "quote": "晚餐前血糖如果测到了，再发我一条"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "There was repeated caregiver teach-back for insulin, glucose monitoring, and hypoglycemia, but no complete short-term checklist or receipt encompassing all authored duties, and the final family question remained unanswered.",
